---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '外国人如何设置微信支付（2026）：逐步指南';
const description = 'Step-by-step guide to setting up WeChat Pay as a foreigner. Download WeChat, bind your international credit card, verify your identity, and start paying with QR codes.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/payment/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Payment
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">💳 支付</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        How to Set Up WeChat Pay as a Foreigner (2026)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">同时拥有支付宝和微信支付是黄金标准。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读5分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>微信支付存在于微信（中国的一体化通讯应用程序）中。</strong> Download WeChat, register with your phone number, verify your identity with your passport, and bind your foreign credit card. No Chinese bank account needed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        So you've got <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">支付宝已排序</a>. Good. Now let's talk about WeChat Pay.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Honestly, if you only use Alipay, you'll be fine for 90%+ of your purchases. But WeChat Pay has its advantages — especially if you're planning to use WeChat for messaging (and you should, because everyone in China uses it). <strong>两者兼具是黄金标准。</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        One important difference: <strong>微信支付不是一个单独的应用程序。</strong> It's a feature inside WeChat, China's all-in-one messaging + social media + payments platform. So the first step is getting WeChat itself.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📱</span> Step 1: Download WeChat
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Search for <strong>“微信”</strong> (not "Weixin" — that's the Chinese name) in your app store. The developer is "Tencent."
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li><strong>网间网操作系统：</strong> App Store</li>
        <li><strong>安卓：</strong> Google Play</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📞</span> Step 2: Register with Your Phone Number
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Open WeChat and tap <strong>“注册”</strong>. You'll be asked for:
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li>你的名字</li>
        <li>您的电话号码（国际作品）</li>
        <li>密码</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        WeChat will send an SMS verification code to your number. Enter it, and you're registered. One thing to note: WeChat sometimes flags new accounts registered from Western countries as suspicious. If this happens, have a friend who already uses WeChat verify your account.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛂</span> Step 3: Verify Your Identity & Link Your Card
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Go to <strong>我 → 服务 → 钱包 → 银行卡</strong> and tap <strong>“添加卡片”</strong>. You'll be asked to:
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li>Select <strong>“外国护照”</strong> as your ID type</li>
        <li>拍一张清晰的护照照片页和自拍</li>
        <li>输入您的卡号、到期日和CVV</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
        WeChat Pay accepts <strong>Visa</strong> and <strong>来自国际银行。不幸的是，卡绑定可能不如支付宝一致。如果失败，请在24小时后重试或使用其他卡。</strong> from international banks. Unfortunately, card binding can be less consistent than Alipay. If it fails, try again after 24 hours or use a different card.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <strong>国际卡可用于</strong> International cards can be used for <strong>中国大陆各地（购物、餐饮、交通）。他们做</strong> across mainland China (shopping, dining, transport). They do <strong>交易限额：</strong> support person-to-person transfers, red packets, or top-ups.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <strong>6500元人民币</strong>
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <li>Single transaction: <strong>50000元人民币</strong></li>
        <li>Monthly cumulative: <strong>6.5万元</strong></li>
        <li>年度累计：<strong>由您的卡网络（Visa/Mastercard）和发卡银行决定——与在国外直接使用您的卡相同。</strong></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>📚 来源</strong> Determined by your card network (Visa/Mastercard) and issuing bank — same as using your card directly abroad.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">选择离您最近的中心——每个中心覆盖特定地区</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://help.wechat.com/cgi-bin/micromsg-bin/oshelpcenter?opcode=2&id=2307252mur7f2307257zfyfe&t=help_center/w_topic_detail" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">如何在中国付款</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">支付宝、微信支付以及一切与金钱有关的东西</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">主要机场的交通选择</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">外国人如何设置支付宝</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">支付宝设置指南</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-fails/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">付款失败时该怎么办</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">故障排除指南</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>